\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Sentinel common-view measurement of both disciplined TGPIO 1~PPS outputs, differenced per second against the atomic reference channel to cancel the instrument timebase. Top: time series over the calibrated window and the TGPIO0 error distribution ($-12 \pm 89$~ns; the spread combines the two channels' trigger noise in quadrature). Bottom: output-to-output skew from the same window, a constant $-1.4$~ns (cable length) with 0.07~ns standard deviation.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
